      "value": "I didn't bother to ask myself if it's exclusive to just the keyboard (it isn't) and all of the UI seems to be affected by this - it just stands out a lot more when working with smaller elements.\n\nI refined the post to represent that the issue doesn't just apply to a keyboard.",
