      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Video like that might be a description to go with it. I think in the video you're focusing the controller lasers of both controllers on the letter J. How far away of keys were you able to type doing that? Is all that head shaking getting the occasional H, or is it all over the place? \n\nIssue like this might be tied to frame rate. So might be easier to experience if typing \"let's get out of here\" in a very laggy world",
