      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Jumping in to confirm that this is a pretty big issue as a fellow frequent chatbox user.\n\nIf someone asks me a yes or no question while I'm typing, my instinct is to nod my head, but I can't because if I do I have to either stop typing and pause to nod, or ignore them and wait to nod/type a reply because otherwise the laser pointers misalign with the keys while moving my head.\n\nI made a similar post about this a long time ago but this explains the issue much better :]",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
